  "jcr:description": "The SoloAssist II system is a unique robotic scope holder with a joystick that surgeons can use to control their field of view during surgery.\r\n\r\nThe SoloAssist II® offers a manual joystick, a steady image in narrow spaces, precise control of endoscope positions, better ergonomics for the surgeon and compatibility with most operating room (OR) tables and endoscopes.",
